sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant RegisterScreen
    participant AuthRepository
    participant FirebaseAuth
    participant Firestore as Firestore (users,<br/>profile/preferences)
    participant LoginScreen

    User->>RegisterScreen: fill username, email, phone, password,<br/>confirmPassword (live debounced validation)
    User->>RegisterScreen: tap "Register"
    RegisterScreen->>AuthRepository: register(username, email, phone, password)
    AuthRepository->>Firestore: query users where username == username

    alt username already exists
        Firestore-->>AuthRepository: doc found
        AuthRepository-->>RegisterScreen: throw AuthException("Username already taken")
        RegisterScreen-->>User: mark username field invalid
    else username available
        Firestore-->>AuthRepository: empty result
        AuthRepository->>FirebaseAuth: createUserWithEmailAndPassword(email, password)
        FirebaseAuth-->>AuthRepository: UserCredential
        AuthRepository->>FirebaseAuth: getIdToken()  (wait for JWT)
        AuthRepository->>FirebaseAuth: updateDisplayName(username)

        rect rgb(247,247,247)
        Note over AuthRepository,Firestore: Atomic WriteBatch (2 docs)
        AuthRepository->>Firestore: users/{uid}.set({username, email, phone,<br/>publicKey:null, isAdmin:false,<br/>isFirstTime:true, createdAt})
        AuthRepository->>Firestore: users/{uid}/profile/preferences.set({<br/>biometricGateEnabled:false, themeMode:'dark',<br/>keyVaultCreatedAt:null, lastVaultAccessAt:null})
        AuthRepository->>Firestore: batch.commit()
        end

        AuthRepository-->>RegisterScreen: success
        RegisterScreen-->>User: SnackBar "Account created successfully!"
        RegisterScreen->>LoginScreen: pushReplacement (after 2s delay)
    end

    alt other failure
        FirebaseAuth-->>AuthRepository: email-already-in-use / generic error
        AuthRepository-->>RegisterScreen: AuthException
        RegisterScreen-->>User: mark email invalid OR<br/>SnackBar "Registration failed."
    end
